{"diagnosis": "Fetch test reports TRAP: no progress max_addr=0x00000000 with tohost FAIL 0xdead after 2009 cycles, expected sequential NOP fetch to advance PC. Default set_mem_do_wdata=1 every clock forces the memory interface into write state instead of idle. Root cause is line 1408 in the excerpt which should clear to 0 like rinst/rdata, stalling fetch and blocking progress.", "patch_diff": "diff --git a/picorv32.v b/picorv32.v
--- a/picorv32.v
+++ b/picorv32.v
@@ -1405,7 +1405,7 @@
 		reg_out <= 'bx;
 		set_mem_do_rinst = 0;
 		set_mem_do_rdata = 0;
-		set_mem_do_wdata = 1;
+		set_mem_do_wdata = 0;

 		alu_out_0_q <= alu_out_0;
 		alu_out_q <= alu_out;
", "expected": "tohost PASS (not FAIL 0xdead), TRAP no progress cleared with max_addr advancing beyond 0x00000000"}

